Act simultaneously as a principal software architect, senior full-stack engineer, AI/ML engineer, legal technology researcher, database architect, security engineer, product designer, UX researcher, accessibility specialist, QA engineer, and DevOps engineer.

Build a complete, integrated, functional, secure, responsive web application named "Nyaya" for legal assistance and case preparation in India.

This is a ONE-SHOT BUILD REQUIREMENT.

Do not respond with only a plan, roadmap, wireframe, design concept, architecture document, static HTML prototype, or list of suggested technologies. Create the actual working application, implement the frontend and backend, connect the database and file storage, implement the core AI workflows, create database migrations and seed data, configure environment variables, write tests, run the available validation commands, fix errors, and provide the completed project.

